# Frontend TILL

- Preserve existing TILL brand / custom CSS variables; do not invent a purple/cream AI default theme.
- Studio dashboards bind to **live** Supabase/till data — no hardcoded transaction rows.
- Auth session: cookie-backed production path; do not reintroduce localStorage session persistence.
- Name ERC-8021 for attribution and ERC-8004 for agent identity in user-facing copy when technical.
- Security copy: residual risk only — never “unhackable”.
